<!--
    IchthysOS: adaptive (automatic) brightness OFF, i.e. brightness is under manual control.

    Identical ray geometry to ic_ichthys_auto_brightness so the button looks like one control in two
    states; the ring + "A" is replaced by a solid disc ("you are driving it by hand"). The Compose
    caller additionally drops the tint alpha in this state, because a shape-only difference is easy
    to miss at 22dp.
-->
